{"id":"vod_sn_36971","vodId":"36971","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"海物语","name_cn":"海物语","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/23a902b09c652e9dea903c85ade6f419.jpg"},"summary":"在这个维度里，世界被分为“海”和“空”两大空间，在海中居住着被称为“海人”的古老民族，在幽暗宁静的海底，他们过着平静纯洁的生活。和海人相对应的，则是在陆地上居住的“空人”，由于缺乏了解，在海人的心目中，空人一直都是高大可怖的存在。　　一日，海人马琳（阿澄佳奈 配音）在海底捡到了一枚戒指，为了将它归还给失主，她和妹妹乌琳（堀江由衣 配音）来到陆地上，开始了一场大冒险。马琳顺利找到了戒指的主人宫守夏音（寿美菜子 配音），可是由于夏音的任性，戒指再度丢失。在寻找戒指的途中，马琳意外的打开了装载着邪恶力量的石棺，世界陷入了危机之中。与此同时，栖息在马琳和夏音体内的巫女力量也开始觉醒，作为“海之巫女”和“空之巫女”，女孩们能够战胜凶恶的幽灵吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DAUm9nRSX21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3MCU5GGWUb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8SU93kDx9m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JWPNEJ9YUx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UcqQFF54fg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hGZ9AKJNkD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zkuk04QTQm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DELtun6TXq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2xgzh3uugK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BAhzFU8qKb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b5n7UZs7CC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qVWum30nHc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/abegLzadiC1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.865Z"}